return ['messages'=>['01e6fb9e2165d5b9dd8c5713598abe02'=>'One of the challenges presented was automating the movement and analysis of proposals — reducing approval or rejection time for Health Plan Credentialing requests for Individual Holders and Beneficiaries.','1f26766b465f2fa82ba4b0631c437c74'=>'The solution features a complete dashboard, allowing visibility into operational capacity, activity execution time, analyst performance, bottlenecks, errors, and key metrics.','344f8c49b7ce12f4a0358870c9a90740'=>'<a href="https://www.simply.com.br/en/electronic-document-analysis-atomics/">Atomics</a> uses artificial intelligence and OCR technology to analyze and electronically validate documents of different types.','481fa39c5204c02b009ed9fe09c7c9e7'=>'Simply specializes in transforming registration, onboarding, and formalization processes.<br><a href="https://evertecinc.com/en/contact/">Talk to an Evertec consultant</a> and increase your team’s productivity with automation.','4a1536aa1c4d524b0a4ae0fb725dd8c5'=>'Reducing registration process time is also a need in the financial sector, where Simply is highly experienced. The company brought to healthcare the best automation and security practices, improving customer experience, reducing costs, and increasing productivity.<br>Watch Simply’s participation in the LinkOne program:','554a38bfb0821e0e63b6d252753415f4'=>' ','59a3cfde966487c3fed858d188470189'=>'<strong>Electronic document analysis</strong>','5ebbe80e66147184511b444e394c4329'=>'Applied technologies','6019022a4c08856024a600c79929c29b'=>'<a href="https://www.simply.com.br/en/automation-of-operational-flows-s-works/">S-Works</a> orchestrates data and maps business rules according to the operational flow, executing registration steps automatically. In exceptional cases requiring human evaluation, S-Works routes tasks to a semi-automated stage where analysts can act quickly and efficiently.','8681c9c7ab757a1987bc1e7f505999a1'=>'Simply was one of the two selected startups now delivering efficiency and process automation to Unimed-BH’s administrative and financial operations.','86dd38edea40c32aa5d672a057ace0b7'=>'It supports more than 50 public document types — including ID, driver’s license, proof of residence — plus custom documents such as contracts and sector-specific agreements.','9cdbfd66740065a160e44b720e1df9b3'=>'<iframe src="//www.youtube.com/embed/L-Rq255kdb0" width="560" height="314" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>','<iframe src="//www.youtube.com/embed/L-Rq255kdb0" width="560" height="314" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>'=>'<iframe src="//www.youtube.com/embed/L-Rq255kdb0" width="560" height="314" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>','<strong>Análise eletrônica dos documentos</strong>'=>'<strong>Electronic document analysis</strong>','<strong>Automação de fluxos operacionais</strong>'=>'<strong>Operational workflow automation</strong>','A <a href="https://simply.com.br/">Simply</a>, fintech especialista em automação e onboarding que faz parte da unidade Digital da Evertec Brasil, foi uma das finalistas da primeira edição do programa de inovação aberta da Unimed. O <a href="https://www.acoesunimedbh.com.br/linkone/">LinkOne</a>, em parceria com a Inseed Investimentos, tem como objetivo conectar a Cooperativa às startups com foco em soluções em saúde.'=>'<a href="https://www.simply.com.br/en/simply-digital-process-automation/">Simply</a>, a fintech specialized in automation and onboarding, part of Evertec Brazil\'s Digital unit — was one of the finalists in the first edition of Unimed’s open innovation program. LinkOne, in collaboration with Inseed Investimentos, aims to connect the Cooperative with startups focused on healthcare technology solutions.','A Simply é especialista em transformar os processos de cadastro, onboarding e formalização das empresas. Converse com um <a href="https://www.evertecinc.com//pt-br/contato">consultor Evertec</a> e aumente a produtividade da sua equipe com automação! '=>'Simply specializes in transforming registration, onboarding, and formalization processes.<br><a href="https://evertecinc.com/en/contact/">Talk to an Evertec consultant</a> and increase your team’s productivity with automation.','A Simply é uma das duas startups contratadas que estão gerando eficiência e <a href="https://trends.sinqia.com.br/automacao-de-processos-e-digitalizacao-por-que-automatizar-a-sua-operacao/">automação de processos</a> na administrativa-financeira da Unimed-BH.'=>'Simply was one of the two selected startups now delivering efficiency and process automation to Unimed-BH’s administrative and financial operations.','A iniciativa, inédita no Brasil no setor de saúde suplementar, encerrou sua primeira edição em 2018 com um DemoDay, evento que contou com cerca de 300 participantes.'=>'This unprecedented initiative in Brazil’s supplemental health market concluded its first edition in 2018 with a DemoDay, gathering nearly 300 participants.','A redução de tempo dos <a href="https://trends.sinqia.com.br/como-a-automacao-de-processos-e-o-ocr-podem-contribuir-com-o-processo-de-cadastro/">processos de cadastro</a> também está presente no mercado financeiro, segmento que a Simply é especialista. A empresa trouxe para o segmento da saúde as melhores práticas de automação e segurança capazes de melhorar a experiência do cliente, reduzir custos e aumentar a produtividade.  Confira o vídeo da participação da Simply no programa LinkOne: '=>'Reducing registration process time is also a need in the financial sector, where Simply is highly experienced. The company brought to healthcare the best automation and security practices, improving customer experience, reducing costs, and increasing productivity.<br>Watch Simply’s participation in the LinkOne program:','A solução permite identificar automaticamente os documentos, ou seja, confere se a imagem enviada pelo cliente é realmente o documento esperado. Também é capaz de extrair as informações dos documentos, para serem utilizadas na automação de fluxos operacionais, e realiza o facematch e validações inteligentes.'=>'The solution allows automatic document recognition — meaning it checks whether the uploaded image matches the expected document type. It also extracts information from documents for automated workflows, in addition to performing facematch and intelligent validation.','Capaz de orquestrar dados e mapear as regras de acordo com o roteiro operacional da operação, o <a href="https://simply.com.br/automacao-de-fluxos-operacionais-s-works/">S-Works</a> executa automaticamente as regras operacionais do fluxo de cadastro. Nos casos de exceção ou para as análises que realmente precisam de um analista para execução, o S-Works deriva para uma atividade semi-automática, onde o analista interage de forma simples e rápida.'=>'<a href="https://www.simply.com.br/en/automation-of-operational-flows-s-works/">S-Works</a> orchestrates data and maps business rules according to the operational flow, executing registration steps automatically. In exceptional cases requiring human evaluation, S-Works routes tasks to a semi-automated stage where analysts can act quickly and efficiently.','Conheça as tecnologias aplicadas à transformação digital dos processos de cadastro da Unimed-BH:'=>'Get to know the technologies that accelerated digital transformation in Unimed-BH’s registration processes:','O <a href="https://simply.com.br/analise-eletronica-documentos-atomics/">Atomics</a> utiliza a inteligência artificial e a tecnologia OCR para analisar e validar eletronicamente os documentos de diversos tipos de cadastro.'=>'<a href="https://www.simply.com.br/en/electronic-document-analysis-atomics/">Atomics</a> uses artificial intelligence and OCR technology to analyze and electronically validate documents of different types.','O S-Works possui um Dashboard completo, capaz de mensurar o capacity (quantas pessoas são necessárias para a operação), o tempo das atividades realizadas pelos analistas, identificar erros, gargalos e acompanhar as principais métricas da operação.'=>'The solution features a complete dashboard, allowing visibility into operational capacity, activity execution time, analyst performance, bottlenecks, errors, and key metrics.','Possui mais de 50 documentos públicos, como RG, CNH e comprovante de residência, além dos documentos personalizados como contratos e termos específicos de cada segmento. '=>'It supports more than 50 public document types — including ID, driver’s license, proof of residence — plus custom documents such as contracts and sector-specific agreements.','Tecnologias aplicadas '=>'Applied technologies','Um dos desafios apresentados é a automação das movimentações das propostas, reduzindo o tempo de aprovação/reprovação das propostas do credenciamento do Plano de Saúde para Pessoa Física (Titular e Beneficiário).'=>'One of the challenges presented was automating the movement and analysis of proposals — reducing approval or rejection time for Health Plan Credentialing requests for Individual Holders and Beneficiaries.','bb859c5862df87692007427b536cad85'=>'This unprecedented initiative in Brazil’s supplemental health market concluded its first edition in 2018 with a DemoDay, gathering nearly 300 participants.','c749b355509b6fb94211a7583bdd1e84'=>'<strong>Operational workflow automation</strong>','c7c1cf97c971a73aaa777a1596648bb9'=>'<a href="https://www.simply.com.br/en/simply-digital-process-automation/">Simply</a>, a fintech specialized in automation and onboarding, part of Evertec Brazil\'s Digital unit — was one of the finalists in the first edition of Unimed’s open innovation program. LinkOne, in collaboration with Inseed Investimentos, aims to connect the Cooperative with startups focused on healthcare technology solutions.','c8babf400b42624e19ccf561e23af036'=>'Get to know the technologies that accelerated digital transformation in Unimed-BH’s registration processes:','cb10c68bb0f456d0a778424b2e9707cf'=>'The solution allows automatic document recognition — meaning it checks whether the uploaded image matches the expected document type. It also extracts information from documents for automated workflows, in addition to performing facematch and intelligent validation.',' '=>' ']];
